  "preview": {
    "tag": "main-e392364",
    "title": "feat: publish and consume update catalog",
    "summary": "\u2022 publish a single machine-readable catalog.json to DroidDeck-CI and regenerate it after main builds, signed PR publishes/cleanup, and Stable release changes\n\u2022 make the Android updater fetch that one static catalog instead of reconstructing channels from multiple GitHub API calls, tags, and release-note text\n\u2022 rename the user-facing Nightly channel to Preview while retaining the existing internal enum/pref value for rollback compatibility\n\u2022 include package name, versionCode, signer SHA-256, APK SHA-256, size, commit, and package-specific download URL in the catalog\n\u2022 reject malformed/unexpected catalog metadata and validate the downloaded APK package, versionCode, size, checksum, and release signer before PackageInstaller sees it\n\u2022 stop offering impossible Stable downgrades when Android would reject the lower versionCode",
